@startuml
title SD-UI07 — Notification follow-up
caption To-Be draft | F07 · Frontend · Customer activity · merchant /merchant/work?kind=NOTICE
actor User
boundary "Route and StatusBanner and NoticeQueue" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
UI -> Client : activity reads, work list and resolve notice
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
else provider uncertain or retries exhausted
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Keep authoritative status and show follow-up
end
@enduml
